{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36605","headline":"贺淮南节度卢员外赐绯 · 罗隐","name":"贺淮南节度卢员外赐绯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俭莲高贵九霄闻，粲粲朱衣降五云。\n骢马早年曾避路，银鱼今日且从军。\n御题彩服垂天眷，袍展花心透縠纹。\n应笑当年老莱子，鲜华都自降明君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}